{
 "id": "R-SWAP-ONCHAIN",
 "statement": "A swap clause in a signed ProofBody settles in a dispute finalize at the taker's fill ratio: each leg is floor(amount * ratio / 65535) on its own, a missing or malformed taker argument is a 0% fill, a clause that moves a delta it has no allowance for reverts the whole finalize, an allowance below the fill caps that delta (clamp, no revert), the n-th ratio is for the n-th swap of its owner, and a ratio the taker committed at the start is the one applied (another is refused).",
 "source": "plan/swap-onchain.md (coordinator decision 10-01 03:11: stock DeltaTransformer, no contract change, expiry off-chain)",
